    "large text field",
    "optional chips: VISUAL DIRECTION \u00b7 LAYOUT \u00b7 COPY \u00b7 COLOR \u00b7 IMAGERY \u00b7 INTERACTION \u00b7 DOESN'T FEEL LIKE MY BRAND \u00b7 OTHER",
    "optional follow-ups: WHAT SHOULD WE KEEP? / WHAT WOULD YOU LIKE TO FEEL DIFFERENT?",
